  "intro": "The Sheriff’s men are burning Wychwood for unpaid taxes. They have caught a giant of a man who tried to stop them, and they mean to hang him at the crossroads.\n\nThis is forest work: Robin carries a quarterstaff today, so every blow knocks out instead of killing. Five soldiers block the west road where the old folk want to flee, and an execution is being readied in the north-east.",
